
@startuml
!pragma teoz true
title FinGuard Phase 9 - UC2: CSV Import, Review, Restore, Confirm
hide footbox
autonumber

actor User as U
boundary "Angular Import Page" as UI
control "ImportController" as C
control "ImportService" as S
participant "CsvParser" as P
participant "EntryValidator" as V
participant "RuleBasedClassifier" as CL
participant "DuplicateDetector" as DD
participant "ImportBatchRepository" as BR
participant "FinancialAccountRepository" as AR
participant "LedgerEntryRepository" as LR
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

note over U,DB
  Preconditions: user is authenticated.
  Target FinancialAccount belongs to user.
  Preview is persisted, but not committed as ledger entries.
end note

group A. Upload CSV and create persistent preview
  U -> UI: Select account and upload CSV
  UI -> C: POST /api/v1/import-batches
  note right of C
    CSV file, accountId,
    Idempotency-Key
  end note
  C -> S: prepareImport(userId, accountId, file, uploadKey)

  S -> BR: findByUserAndUploadKey(userId, uploadKey)
  BR -> DB: SELECT import_batch
  DB --> BR: Existing batch or none
  BR --> S: Result

  alt Same key and same file
    S --> C: Existing Preview
    C --> UI: HTTP 200
  else Same key but different file
    S --> C: Idempotency conflict
    C --> UI: HTTP 409
  else New upload
    S -> P: parse(file)
    P --> S: ParseResult

    alt Fatal CSV parsing error
      S --> C: Validation errors
      C --> UI: HTTP 422
    else File is parseable
      S -> V: validate(parsedRows)
      V --> S: RowValidationResult

      S -> CL: suggestCategories(validRows)
      CL --> S: SuggestedCategories

      S -> DD: findPotentialMatches(rows, accountId, 15min)

      DD -> LR: findNearbyLedgerEntries(...)
      LR -> DB: Indexed SELECT
      DB --> LR: Potential ledger matches
      LR --> DD: Matches

      DD -> BR: findOtherActivePreviewMatches(...)
      BR -> DB: SELECT reviewing candidates
      DB --> BR: Matching candidates and batch IDs
      BR --> DD: Matches

      DD --> S: DuplicateWarnings

      S -> BR: saveBatchAndCandidates(REVIEWING)
      BR -> DB: INSERT import_batch
      BR -> DB: INSERT import_candidate
      DB --> BR: batchId and candidateIds
      BR --> S: Saved preview

      S --> C: PreviewResult
      C --> UI: HTTP 201
    end
  end

  UI --> U: Display preview and warnings
end

opt B. User returns to unfinished import
  U -> UI: Open Imports page
  UI -> C: GET /api/v1/import-batches?status=REVIEWING
  C -> S: getActivePreviews(userId)
  S -> BR: findReviewingBatches(userId)
  BR -> DB: SELECT batches and candidates
  DB --> BR: Saved preview
  BR --> S: Reviewable batches
  S --> C: Preview summaries
  C --> UI: HTTP 200
  UI --> U: Resume or Discard
end

opt C. User edits review
  U -> UI: Edit category / exclude / acknowledge warning
  UI -> C: PATCH /api/v1/import-batches/{id}/review
  C -> S: updateReview(userId, batchId, decisions)

  S -> V: validate(changedRows)
  V --> S: ValidationResult

  S -> BR: saveReviewChanges(...)
  BR -> DB: UPDATE import_candidate and review decisions
  DB --> BR: Saved
  BR --> S: Updated preview
  S --> C: Updated preview
  C --> UI: HTTP 200
end

group D. Confirm import - One database transaction
  U -> UI: Confirm selected entries
  UI -> C: POST /api/v1/import-batches/{id}/confirm
  C -> S: confirm(userId, batchId)

  note over S,DB #FFF2CC
    @Transactional
    All inserts and the batch status update
    commit or rollback together.
  end note

  S -> BR: findByIdForUpdate(batchId, userId)
  BR -> DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
  DB --> BR: Locked ImportBatch
  BR --> S: Batch and status

  alt Already CONFIRMED
    S --> C: Previous confirmation result
    C --> UI: HTTP 200, no new inserts
  else Not REVIEWING
    S --> C: Invalid batch status
    C --> UI: HTTP 409
  else REVIEWING
    S -> AR: lockAccountForImport(accountId)
    AR -> DB: SELECT financial_account FOR UPDATE
    DB --> AR: Account lock
    AR --> S: Lock acquired

    S -> V: validateSelectedCandidates(...)
    V --> S: ValidationResult

    S -> DD: recheckAgainstCommittedLedger(...)
    DD -> LR: findNearbyLedgerEntries(...)
    LR -> DB: Indexed set-based SELECT
    DB --> LR: Current matches
    LR --> DD: Matches
    DD --> S: Strong duplicates and new warnings

    alt Strong duplicate or unacknowledged new warning
      S --> C: ConflictResult
      C --> UI: HTTP 409, re-review required
      UI --> U: Review changed matches
    else Safe or weak warnings acknowledged
      S -> LR: bulkInsertSelected(batchId, candidates)
      LR -> DB: INSERT ledger_entry rows

      note right of DB
        UNIQUE(source_candidate_id)
        UNIQUE(account_id, bank_txn_id)
        when bank_txn_id is present
      end note

      alt Database uniqueness conflict
        DB --> LR: Constraint violation
        LR --> S: Exception, rollback
        S --> C: Conflict
        C --> UI: HTTP 409
      else Insert successful
        DB --> LR: Inserted entries
        LR --> S: Created count

        S -> BR: markConfirmedAndStoreResult(...)
        BR -> DB: UPDATE import_batch
        DB --> BR: Updated
        BR --> S: Saved result

        S --> C: ConfirmationResult
        C --> UI: HTTP 200
        UI --> U: Confirmation page
      end
    end
  end
end

note over DD,DB
  Weak duplicate warning:
  Same account + type + currency + amount
  within 15 minutes.
  Never auto-delete a legitimate repeated purchase.
end note
@enduml
